flowchart TD
  X0["Data x₀"] -->|"add noise, T small steps"| XT["Pure noise x_T"]
  X0 --> TR["Training: pick t, noise x₀ in one jump<br/>x_t = √ᾱ·x₀ + √(1−ᾱ)·ε"]
  TR --> NET["Network ε_θ(x_t, t)<br/>predicts the noise"]
  NET --> L["Loss: ‖ε − ε_θ‖²"]
  XT --> SA["Sampling: start from noise"]
  SA --> ST["Remove predicted noise,<br/>step t → t−1"]
  ST -->|"repeat T times"| ST
  ST --> OUT["Generated sample"]
